milkdropper (1.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Sister-project interop with PipeDreams (github.com/sworrl/pipedreams):
    - "Open PipeDreams" tray entry when PipeDreams is installed.
    - Single-instance socket is now message-based: "ping" returns version and
      mode without popping the menu, so sister apps can probe liveness safely.
    - The shared control contract is documented in docs/INTEROP.md.
  * High-detail app icon at all hicolor sizes; desktop entries, notifications
    and window icon use it (tray mode-state icons remain SVG).

 -- reaver <agent.jearl@gmail.com>  Sun, 09 Aug 2026 14:45:00 +0000

milkdropper (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Single-instance guard: launching MilkDropper while it is already running
    now opens the running instance's tray menu instead of starting a duplicate.
  * Multi-monitor fix: preset/audio commands now reach the renderer on every
    screen (the command file was consumed by whichever screen polled first).
  * RGB music sync now auto-starts its FFT audio server (audio-fft.py) —
    previously it silently synced to permanent silence.
  * audio-fft.py: bind errors are fatal instead of silent; parec is respawned
    if it dies; capture-window.py moved off the FFT server's port.
  * milkdropper-cycle-mode works from the installed location; X11 mode state
    directory is created on demand.
  * Tray: prompt SIGTERM handling (wallpaper is restored on kill/logout),
    qdbus6 fallback, OpenRGB discovered from PATH before the custom build.

 -- reaver <agent.jearl@gmail.com>  Sun, 09 Aug 2026 14:00:00 +0000

milkdropper (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging.
  * Renderer ported from the libprojectM 3.x C++ API to the projectM 4 C API.
  * All machine-specific paths replaced with runtime discovery.

